            "review_title": "Review at Hanoian Home Bar & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Cathy M\n5 contributions\n0\nWould give more than 5 stars if I could\nFeb 2023 • Friends\nMy Hanoian Home experiences were unforgettable. I've visited this restaurant thrice in one week. The staff were kind and friendly, service was excellent, ambience was elegant, and the food was divine! *Chef's kiss* The best part? It doesn't break the bank. If you want a quiet and chill place to hang out with your friends, or a romantic spot for a date, this is your lot. Highly recommend!!!\nRead more\nWritten February 22, 2023",
