            "review_text": "Maria\n4 contributions\n0\nI enjoyed here!!!\nMay 2022\nThis restaurant have good food and alcohol .I heard they make fusion food that use good product of vietnam. One staff recommended Vietnamese gin \" Song Cai \" that is made in Hanoi. It was very very nice. And all staff is so kind . I had a relaxing time with my friends ! I I will come again . Thank you so much !\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 30, 2022\nHelena\nDear Maria,\n\nIt is so glad to see you at Hanoian home. Thank you so much for your incredible review for us.\n\nIt is our pleasure having you with us and we look forward to welcoming you again very soon.\n\nBest wishes,\nHanoian home\nRead more\nWritten June 1, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
